<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Connect"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="コネクト"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="KAF"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="kaf"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="かふ"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="花譜"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="花谱"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Transcendent Love"/><amll:meta key="album" value="深愛"/><amll:meta key="album" value="深爱"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPB602601148"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="3383669231"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="0031SPaV2GrNoR"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="667146780"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="7D6ySaXnE36lrgY1EgHPhL"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="6764277992"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="174598250"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="ASyunagi"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:50.660"><div begin="1.170" end="3:50.660"><p begin="1.170" end="4.200" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1.170" end="1.300">は</span><span begin="1.430" end="1.700">て</span><span begin="2.020" end="2.490">誰</span><span begin="2.660" end="3.100">か</span><span begin="3.100" end="3.530">ら</span><span begin="3.530" end="3.780">で</span><span begin="3.900" end="4.200">しょう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">咦 会是谁送来的呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">咦 會是誰送來的呢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Now then who could it be from</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">글쎄 누구에게서 온 걸까요</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tiens de qui cela peut-il venir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Me pregunto de quién será</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Nun von wem mag es wohl sein</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ora de quem será</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Интересно от кого же это</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Chissà da chi sarà</span></p><p begin="4.580" end="9.860" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4.580" end="5.110">控</span><span begin="5.390" end="5.640">え</span><span begin="5.640" end="6.040">め</span><span begin="6.040" end="6.490">に</span><span begin="6.490" end="7.320">赤</span><span begin="7.320" end="7.470">い</span><span begin="7.730" end="7.960">リ</span><span begin="8.160" end="8.590">ボン</span><span begin="8.590" end="8.800">を</span><span begin="8.990" end="9.230">か</span><span begin="9.230" end="9.360">け</span><span begin="9.460" end="9.860">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">系着一条低调的红色丝带</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">繫著一條低調的紅色絲帶</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Tied with a modest red ribbon</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">수수하게 빨간 리본을 두른</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Discrètement orné d’un ruban rouge</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Con una discreta cinta roja atada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Mit einer dezenten roten Schleife versehen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Com uma discreta fita vermelha amarrada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">С неброско повязанной красной лентой</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Con un discreto nastro rosso</span></p><p begin="10.240" end="14.380" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="10.240" end="10.650">小</span><span begin="10.650" end="10.900">さ</span><span begin="10.900" end="11.070">い</span><span begin="11.070" end="11.950">箱</span><span begin="11.950" end="12.140">の</span><span begin="12.400" end="12.600">プ</span><span begin="12.600" end="12.750">レ</span><span begin="12.840" end="13.560">ゼ</span><span begin="13.670" end="13.900">ン</span><span begin="14.060" end="14.380">ト</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是一份装在小小盒子里的礼物</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">是一份裝在小小盒子裡的禮物</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">A present in a little box</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">작은 상자 속 선물</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Un cadeau dans une petite boîte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Un regalo en una pequeña caja</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ein Geschenk in einer kleinen Schachtel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Um presente numa pequena caixa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Подарок в маленькой коробочке</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Un regalo in una piccola scatola</span></p><p begin="14.700" end="17.690" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.700" end="15.290">贈</span><span begin="15.550" end="15.690">り</span><span begin="15.690" end="16.070">物</span><span begin="16.200" end="16.560">と</span><span begin="16.560" end="16.700">い</span><span begin="16.700" end="17.010">う</span><span begin="17.010" end="17.450">よ</span><span begin="17.450" end="17.690">り</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与其说是赠礼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">與其說是贈禮</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Rather than a gift</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">선물이라기보다는</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Plutôt qu’un présent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Más que un regalo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Eher als ein Geschenk</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mais do que um presente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Скорее даже не подарок</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Più che un dono</span></p><p begin="18.080" end="20.990" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="18.080" end="18.630">忘</span><span begin="18.940" end="19.060">れ</span><span begin="19.060" end="19.480">物</span><span begin="19.570" end="19.870">に</span><span begin="19.980" end="20.830">近</span><span begin="20.830" end="20.990">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">倒更像是一件遗落之物</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">倒更像是一件遺落之物</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">It feels more like something left behind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">두고 간 물건에 가까워</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Cela ressemble davantage à quelque chose d’oublié</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Se parece más a algo olvidado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ist es etwas Vergessenem ähnlich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Parece algo que alguém esqueceu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">А что-то забытое</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Somiglia a qualcosa che è stato dimenticato</span></p><p begin="21.230" end="23.390" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.230" end="21.630">人</span><span begin="21.630" end="22.100">生</span><span begin="22.100" end="22.320">を</span><span begin="22.500" end="22.740">か</span><span begin="22.740" end="22.870">け</span><span begin="22.980" end="23.390">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">赌上一生</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">賭上一生</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Devoting an entire life</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">일생을 걸고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">En y consacrant toute une vie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Dedicando toda una vida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ein ganzes Leben dafür einsetzen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Apostando uma vida inteira</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Поставив на кон всю жизнь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Mettendoci in gioco un&apos;intera vita</span></p><p begin="23.740" end="28.000" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.740" end="24.010">世</span><span begin="24.160" end="24.520">界</span><span begin="24.630" end="24.880">と</span><span begin="25.060" end="25.470">交</span><span begin="25.470" end="25.870">信</span><span begin="25.870" end="26.100">す</span><span begin="26.100" end="26.270">る</span><span begin="26.360" end="27.140">た</span><span begin="27.240" end="27.500">め</span><span begin="27.620" end="28.000">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了与这个世界取得联系</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">為了與這個世界取得聯繫</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">For the sake of communicating with the world</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">세상과 교신하기 위한</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pour communiquer avec le monde</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Para comunicarme con el mundo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Um mit der Welt Verbindung aufzunehmen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Para se comunicar com o mundo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Чтобы связаться с миром</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Per comunicare con il mondo</span></p><p begin="32.190" end="34.770" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.190" end="32.540">奇</span><span begin="32.670" end="33.030">妙</span><span begin="33.120" end="33.820">な</span><span begin="33.930" end="34.230">手</span><span begin="34.320" end="34.770">法</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所采用的奇妙方式</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">所採用的奇妙方式</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">A strange method</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">기묘한 방법</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Une étrange méthode</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Un método extraño</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Eine seltsame Methode</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Um método estranho</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Странный способ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Uno strano metodo</span></p><p begin="41.320" end="43.610" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.320" end="41.750">宙</span><span begin="41.750" end="41.870">を</span><span begin="41.980" end="42.170">舞</span><span begin="42.170" end="42.420">う</span><span begin="42.600" end="42.920">パー</span><span begin="43.020" end="43.120">ティ</span><span begin="43.220" end="43.430">ク</span><span begin="43.430" end="43.610">ル</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">漫舞于空中的粒子</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">漫舞於空中的粒子</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Particles dancing through the air</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">허공을 떠도는 파티클</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Des particules dansent dans les airs</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Partículas que danzan en el aire</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Partikel die durch die Luft tanzen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Partículas dançando pelo ar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Частицы танцуют в воздухе</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Particelle che danzano nell&apos;aria</span></p><p begin="43.850" end="47.790" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.850" end="44.280">音</span><span begin="44.280" end="44.510">と</span><span begin="44.510" end="44.730">な</span><span begin="44.730" end="44.910">る</span><span begin="45.170" end="45.560">韻</span><span begin="45.560" end="45.770">と</span><span begin="45.770" end="45.990">な</span><span begin="45.990" end="46.150">る</span><span begin="46.360" end="46.600">そ</span><span begin="46.600" end="46.780">の</span><span begin="46.780" end="47.330">光</span><span begin="47.460" end="47.790">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那光芒化作声音 化作韵律</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那光芒化作聲音 化作韻律</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">That light becomes sound becomes rhyme</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">소리가 되고 운이 되는 그 빛이</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Cette lumière devient son devient rime</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Esa luz se vuelve sonido se vuelve rima</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Dieses Licht wird zum Klang wird zum Reim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Essa luz se torna som se torna rima</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Этот свет становится звуком становится рифмой</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Quella luce diventa suono diventa rima</span></p><p begin="48.060" end="50.360" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.060" end="48.520">節</span><span begin="48.520" end="48.720">に</span><span begin="48.720" end="48.930">な</span><span begin="48.930" end="49.080">る</span><span begin="49.360" end="49.780">文</span><span begin="49.780" end="49.990">に</span><span begin="49.990" end="50.200">な</span><span begin="50.200" end="50.360">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">又化作乐句 化作文字</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">又化作樂句 化作文字</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Becomes verse becomes words</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">구절이 되고 문장이 돼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Devient vers devient phrase</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Se vuelve verso se vuelve frase</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wird zum Vers wird zum Satz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Se torna verso se torna frase</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Становится строфой становится фразой</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Diventa verso diventa frase</span></p><p begin="50.610" end="52.650" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.610" end="51.020">耳</span><span begin="51.020" end="51.240">を</span><span begin="51.240" end="51.460">撫</span><span begin="51.460" end="51.670">で</span><span begin="51.670" end="51.850">る</span><span begin="52.120" end="52.320">撫</span><span begin="52.320" end="52.520">で</span><span begin="52.520" end="52.650">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一遍又一遍 轻抚耳畔</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">一遍又一遍 輕撫耳畔</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Caressing my ears caressing them</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">귀를 어루만져 어루만져</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Elle caresse mes oreilles les caresse</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Acaricia acaricia los oídos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Streichelt über die Ohren streichelt sie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Acaricia os ouvidos acaricia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ласкает слух ласкает</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Accarezza l&apos;orecchio accarezza</span></p><p begin="52.730" end="54.510" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.730" end="52.820">聴</span><span begin="52.920" end="53.160">こ</span><span begin="53.160" end="53.280">え</span><span begin="53.380" end="53.580">て</span><span begin="53.580" end="53.690">い</span><span begin="53.780" end="54.040">ま</span><span begin="54.040" end="54.200">す</span><span begin="54.200" end="54.480">か</span><span begin="54.480" end="54.510">？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你听见了吗</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你聽見了嗎</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Can you hear it?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">들리고 있나요</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Est-ce que tu m’entends ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">¿Puedes oírme?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Kannst du es hören?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Você consegue ouvir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ты меня слышишь?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Riesci a sentirla?</span></p><p begin="54.820" end="57.130" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.820" end="55.240">反</span><span begin="55.240" end="55.440">射</span><span begin="55.440" end="55.690">す</span><span begin="55.690" end="55.890">る</span><span begin="56.100" end="56.430">パー</span><span begin="56.520" end="56.720">ティ</span><span begin="56.720" end="56.950">ク</span><span begin="56.950" end="57.130">ル</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不断反射的粒子</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">不斷反射的粒子</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Particles reflecting back</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">반사되는 파티클</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Des particules qui se réfléchissent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Partículas que se reflejan</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Partikel die sich spiegeln</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Partículas refletidas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Отражающиеся частицы</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Particelle che si riflettono</span></p><p begin="57.370" end="1:01.300" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.370" end="57.790">鍵</span><span begin="57.790" end="58.020">を</span><span begin="58.020" end="58.160">解</span><span begin="58.260" end="58.440">く</span><span begin="58.670" end="58.880">戸</span><span begin="58.880" end="59.050">を</span><span begin="59.050" end="59.410">開</span><span begin="59.520" end="59.710">く</span><span begin="59.920" end="1:00.350">愛</span><span begin="1:00.350" end="1:00.560">の</span><span begin="1:00.560" end="1:00.870">庭</span><span begin="1:00.980" end="1:01.300">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">解开门锁 推开门扉 通往爱的庭园</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">解開門鎖 推開門扉 通往愛的庭園</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">A garden of love that unlocks the key and opens the door</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">자물쇠를 풀고 문을 여는 사랑의 정원이</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le jardin de l’amour déverrouille la serrure ouvre la porte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El jardín del amor que descifra la clave y abre la puerta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Der Garten der Liebe löst den Schlüssel und öffnet die Tür</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O jardim do amor destranca a fechadura abre a porta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сад любви отпирает замок открывает дверь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il giardino dell&apos;amore scioglie la serratura apre la porta</span></p><p begin="1:01.630" end="1:04.610" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.630" end="1:02.030">会</span><span begin="1:02.030" end="1:02.230">話</span><span begin="1:02.230" end="1:02.450">す</span><span begin="1:02.450" end="1:02.620">る</span><span begin="1:02.870" end="1:03.290">対</span><span begin="1:03.290" end="1:03.460">話</span><span begin="1:03.460" end="1:03.710">す</span><span begin="1:03.710" end="1:03.880">る</span><span begin="1:04.120" end="1:04.610">今</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">彼此交谈 彼此对话 就在此刻</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">彼此交談 彼此對話 就在此刻</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Conversing exchanging words now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이야기하고 대화하는 지금</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Il converse il dialogue maintenant</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Conversa dialoga ahora</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Spricht miteinander tritt in Dialog jetzt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Conversa dialoga agora</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Разговаривает вступает в диалог сейчас</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Conversa dialoga proprio adesso</span></p><p begin="1:04.970" end="1:06.020" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.970" end="1:05.250">会</span><span begin="1:05.250" end="1:05.410">い</span><span begin="1:05.410" end="1:05.510">に</span><span begin="1:05.600" end="1:05.840">来</span><span begin="1:05.840" end="1:06.020">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">前来与我相见</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">前來與我相見</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Coming to meet me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나를 만나러 와</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Il vient à ma rencontre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Viene a encontrarme</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Kommt mich besuchen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vem ao meu encontro</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Приходит ко мне</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Viene a incontrarmi</span></p><p begin="1:06.250" end="1:07.990" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.250" end="1:06.540">in</span><span begin="1:06.660" end="1:07.080">to</span> <span begin="1:07.080" end="1:07.310">the</span> <span begin="1:07.310" end="1:07.410">ワ</span><span begin="1:07.520" end="1:07.620">タ</span><span begin="1:07.720" end="1:07.990">シ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">走进「我」的深处</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">走進「我」的深處</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">into the ME</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">ワタシの内へ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xm