l:lang="ko">나를 만나러 와</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Il vient à ma rencontre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Viene a encontrarme</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Kommt mich besuchen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vem ao meu encontro</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Приходит ко мне</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Viene a incontrarmi</span></p><p begin="1:19.770" end="1:21.470" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.770" end="1:20.090">in</span><span begin="1:20.210" end="1:20.600">to</span> <span begin="1:20.600" end="1:20.820">the</span> <span begin="1:20.820" end="1:20.910">ワ</span><span begin="1:21.030" end="1:21.130">タ</span><span begin="1:21.220" end="1:21.470">シ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">走进「我」的深处</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">走進「我」的深處</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">into the ME</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">ワタシの内へ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내 안으로</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Dans le Moi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Dentro de MÍ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Hinein in das ICH</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Para dentro de mim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Внутрь меня</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dentro di ME</span></p><p begin="1:26.520" end="1:28.260" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.520" end="1:26.860">根</span><span begin="1:26.950" end="1:27.380">底</span><span begin="1:27.380" end="1:27.590">の</span><span begin="1:27.590" end="1:28.260">私</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最深处的我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">最深處的我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The me at my very core</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">근원에 있는 나</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le moi au plus profond</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Mi yo más profundo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das Ich in meinem tiefsten Inneren</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu em minhas raízes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">К той мне что лежит в самой глубине</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il mio io più profondo</span></p><p begin="1:31.980" end="1:35.080" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.980" end="1:32.460">声</span><span begin="1:32.460" end="1:32.570">に</span><span begin="1:32.660" end="1:32.870">な</span><span begin="1:32.870" end="1:33.060">る</span><span begin="1:33.270" end="1:33.630">根</span><span begin="1:33.720" end="1:34.140">底</span><span begin="1:34.140" end="1:34.350">の</span><span begin="1:34.350" end="1:35.080">私</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">化作声音的 最深处的我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">化作聲音的 最深處的我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The me at my very core becoming a voice</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">목소리가 되는 근원에 있는 나</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le moi au plus profond devient une voix</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Mi yo más profundo se convierte en voz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das Ich in meinem tiefsten Inneren das zur Stimme wird</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu em minhas raízes que se transforma em voz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">К той глубинной мне что становится голосом</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il mio io più profondo diventa voce</span></p><p begin="1:49.330" end="1:52.280" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:49.330" end="1:49.880">胸</span><span begin="1:50.190" end="1:50.300">に</span><span begin="1:50.300" end="1:50.410">仕</span><span begin="1:50.410" end="1:50.620">舞</span><span begin="1:50.620" end="1:50.730">う</span><span begin="1:50.840" end="1:51.050">と</span><span begin="1:51.050" end="1:51.560">痛</span><span begin="1:51.560" end="1:51.710">い</span><span begin="1:51.710" end="1:51.940">の</span><span begin="1:52.110" end="1:52.280">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为藏在心里会隐隐作痛</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">因為藏在心裡會隱隱作痛</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Because keeping it shut inside my heart hurts</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">가슴에 넣어 두면 아프니까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Puisque le garder dans ma poitrine me fait mal</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Como duele guardarlo en el pecho</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Weil es wehtut es in meiner Brust aufzubewahren</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Como dói guardá-lo dentro do peito</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Хранить это в груди слишком больно</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Fa male tenerlo chiuso nel petto</span></p><p begin="1:52.690" end="1:55.630" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:52.690" end="1:53.670">枕</span><span begin="1:53.670" end="1:54.110">元</span><span begin="1:54.230" end="1:54.610">に</span><span begin="1:54.610" end="1:54.950">放</span><span begin="1:54.950" end="1:55.360">っ</span><span begin="1:55.480" end="1:55.630">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以曾把它随手丢在枕边</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">所以曾把它隨手丟在枕邊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I tossed it beside my pillow</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">베갯머리에 내던져 둔</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je l’ai laissé près de mon oreiller</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Lo arrojé junto a la almohada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Warf ich es neben mein Kopfkissen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Joguei-o ao lado do travesseiro</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Поэтому я бросила это у изголовья</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Così l&apos;ho gettato accanto al cuscino</span></p><p begin="1:55.850" end="2:02.470" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:55.850" end="1:56.740">齢</span><span begin="1:56.740" end="1:57.000">十</span><span begin="1:57.130" end="1:57.610">数</span><span begin="1:57.610" end="1:57.970">の</span><span begin="1:58.420" end="1:59.180">夢</span><span begin="1:59.270" end="1:59.530">を</span><span begin="1:59.710" end="2:00.130">取</span><span begin="2:00.130" end="2:00.420">り</span><span begin="2:00.550" end="2:00.740">出</span><span begin="2:00.740" end="2:00.880">し</span><span begin="2:01.000" end="2:01.740">て</span><span begin="2:01.850" end="2:02.200">み</span><span begin="2:02.200" end="2:02.470">よう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">试着重新拾起十几岁时的梦想吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">試著重新拾起十幾歲時的夢想吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Let&apos;s take out that dream from my teenage years</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">십수 년 묵은 꿈을 꺼내 보자</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Essayons de ressortir ce rêve de mes années d’adolescence</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Saquemos aquel sueño de cuando tenía poco más de diez años</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Holen wir die Träume meiner Teenagerjahre wieder hervor</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos tirar de lá o sonho dos meus tantos anos de juventude</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Давай достанем мечту моих подростковых лет</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Proviamo a tirare fuori i sogni dei miei anni da adolescente</span></p><p begin="2:02.860" end="2:09.300" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:02.860" end="2:03.490">形</span><span begin="2:03.710" end="2:03.880">は</span><span begin="2:03.880" end="2:05.080">歪</span><span begin="2:05.080" end="2:05.870">だ</span><span begin="2:05.870" end="2:06.070">し</span><span begin="2:06.270" end="2:06.400">手</span><span begin="2:06.490" end="2:06.790">段</span><span begin="2:06.790" end="2:06.860">と</span><span begin="2:06.860" end="2:07.060">し</span><span begin="2:07.060" end="2:07.180">て</span><span begin="2:07.180" end="2:07.350">は</span><span begin="2:07.350" end="2:07.750">面</span><span begin="2:07.750" end="2:08.180">倒</span><span begin="2:08.180" end="2:08.360">く</span><span begin="2:08.480" end="2:09.080">さ</span><span begin="2:09.080" end="2:09.300">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">模样虽有些歪斜 作为一种方式也着实麻烦</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">模樣雖有些歪斜 作為一種方式也著實麻煩</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Its shape is distorted and as a method it&apos;s cumbersome</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">모양도 일그러졌고 수단으로서는 번거롭지만</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Sa forme est imparfaite et comme moyen c’est bien compliqué</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Su forma es irregular y como método resulta engorroso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ihre Form ist verzerrt und als Methode ist es umständlich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sua forma é irregular e como método é complicado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Форма у неё неровная да и как способ она довольно хлопотная</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La forma è irregolare e come metodo è macchinosa</span></p><p begin="2:09.820" end="2:16.250" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:09.820" end="2:10.280">ほ</span><span begin="2:10.280" end="2:10.530">ら</span><span begin="2:10.690" end="2:10.850">で</span><span begin="2:10.940" end="2:11.170">も</span><span begin="2:11.170" end="2:11.530">ね</span><span begin="2:11.930" end="2:12.390">鮮</span><span begin="2:12.390" end="2:12.820">明</span><span begin="2:12.820" end="2:13.090">に</span><span begin="2:13.210" end="2:13.670">再</span><span begin="2:13.670" end="2:14.100">生</span><span begin="2:14.100" end="2:14.350">で</span><span begin="2:14.350" end="2:14.590">き</span><span begin="2:14.590" end="2:15.040">る</span><span begin="2:15.460" end="2:15.670">で</span><span begin="2:15.830" end="2:16.250">しょ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可是你看 依然能够如此清晰地重现吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">可是你看 依然能夠如此清晰地重現吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">See but you can still replay it vividly can&apos;t you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그래도 봐 선명하게 재생할 수 있잖아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mais regarde on peut quand même le reproduire avec netteté n’est-ce pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Pero mira aun así puedes reproducirlo con nitidez</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Aber sieh doch man kann sie noch immer so deutlich wiedergeben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mas veja mesmo assim dá para reproduzi-lo com tanta nitidez não é</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Но смотри ведь её можно воспроизвести так отчётливо</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Guarda però riesci a riprodurli nitidamente vero</span></p><p begin="2:29.890" end="2:32.210" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:29.890" end="2:30.320">宙</span><span begin="2:30.320" end="2:30.550">を</span><span begin="2:30.550" end="2:30.760">舞</span><span begin="2:30.760" end="2:30.960">う</span><span begin="2:31.180" end="2:31.590">パー</span><span begin="2:31.590" end="2:31.800">ティ</span><span begin="2:31.800" end="2:32.020">ク</span><span begin="2:32.020" end="2:32.210">ル</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">漫舞于空中的粒子</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">漫舞於空中的粒子</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Particles dancing through the air</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">허공을 떠도는 파티클</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Des particules dansent dans les airs</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Partículas que danzan en el aire</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Partikel die durch die Luft tanzen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Partículas dançando pelo ar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Частицы танцуют в воздухе</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Particelle che danzano nell&apos;aria</span></p><p begin="2:32.450" end="2:36.350" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:32.450" end="2:32.870">音</span><span begin="2:32.870" end="2:33.100">と</span><span begin="2:33.100" end="2:33.330">な</span><span begin="2:33.330" end="2:33.500">る</span><span begin="2:33.750" end="2:34.160">韻</span><span begin="2:34.160" end="2:34.380">と</span><span begin="2:34.380" end="2:34.600">な</span><span begin="2:34.600" end="2:34.750">る</span><span begin="2:34.960" end="2:35.220">そ</span><span begin="2:35.220" end="2:35.370">の</span><span begin="2:35.370" end="2:35.900">光</span><span begin="2:36.030" end="2:36.350">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那光芒化作声音 化作韵律</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那光芒化作聲音 化作韻律</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">That light becomes sound becomes rhyme</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">소리가 되고 운이 되는 그 빛이</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Cette lumière devient son devient rime</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Esa luz se vuelve sonido se vuelve rima</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Dieses Licht wird zum Klang wird zum Reim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Essa luz se torna som se torna rima</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Этот свет становится звуком становится рифмой</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Quella luce diventa suono diventa rima</span></p><p begin="2:36.670" end="2:38.950" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:36.670" end="2:37.120">節</span><span begin="2:37.120" end="2:37.320">に</span><span begin="2:37.320" end="2:37.520">な</span><span begin="2:37.520" end="2:37.700">る</span><span begin="2:37.940" end="2:38.360">文</span><span begin="2:38.360" end="2:38.570">に</span><span begin="2:38.570" end="2:38.780">な</span><span begin="2:38.780" end="2:38.950">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">又化作乐句 化作文字</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">又化作樂句 化作文字</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Becomes verse becomes words</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">구절이 되고 문장이 돼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Devient vers devient phrase</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Se vuelve verso se vuelve frase</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wird zum Vers wird zum Satz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Se torna verso se torna frase</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Становится строфой становится фразой</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Diventa verso diventa frase</span></p><p begin="2:39.200" end="2:41.310" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:39.200" end="2:39.610">耳</span><span begin="2:39.610" end="2:39.830">を</span><span begin="2:39.830" end="2:40.040">撫</span><span begin="2:40.040" end="2:40.250">で</span><span begin="2:40.250" end="2:40.460">る</span><span begin="2:40.700" end="2:40.920">撫</span><span begin="2:40.920" end="2:41.120">で</span><span begin="2:41.120" end="2:41.310">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一遍又一遍 轻抚耳畔</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">一遍又一遍 輕撫耳畔</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Caressing my ears caressing them</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">귀를 어루만져 어루만져</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Elle caresse mes oreilles les caresse</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Acaricia acaricia los oídos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Streichelt über die Ohren streichelt sie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Acaricia os ouvidos acaricia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ласкает слух ласкает</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Accarezza l&apos;orecchio accarezza</span></p><p begin="2:41.390" end="2:43.130" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:41.390" end="2:41.530">聴</span><span begin="2:41.530" end="2:41.750">こ</span><span begin="2:41.750" end="2:41.960">え</span><span begin="2:41.960" end="2:42.170">て</span><span begin="2:42.170" end="2:42.390">い</span><span begin="2:42.390" end="2:42.630">ま</span><span begin="2:42.630" end="2:42.810">す</span><span begin="2:42.810" end="2:43.100">か</span><span begin="2:43.100" end="2:43.130">？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你听见了吗</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你聽見了嗎</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Can you hear it?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">들리고 있나요</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Est-ce que tu m’entends ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">¿Puedes oírme?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Kannst du es hören?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Você consegue ouvir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ты меня слышишь?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Riesci a sentirla?</span></p><p begin="2:43.430" end="2:47.040" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:43.430" end="2:43.840">静</span><span begin="2:43.840" end="2:44.210">寂</span><span begin="2:44.310" end="2:44.570">と</span><span begin="2:44.680" end="2:45.120">旋</span><span begin="2:45.120" end="2:45.560">律</span><span begin="2:45.560" end="2:45.740">が</span><span begin="2:45.980" end="2:46.400">織</span><span begin="2:46.400" end="2:46.600">を</span><span begin="2:46.600" end="2:46.720">成</span><span begin="2:46.840" end="2:47.040">す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">寂静与旋律彼此交织</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">寂靜與旋律彼此交織</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Silence and melody weave themselves together</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">정적과 선율이 하나의 직조를 이루는</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le silence et la mélodie se tissent ensemble</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El silencio y la melodía forman un tejido</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Stille und Melodie verweben sich zu einem Geflecht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O silêncio e a melodia se entrelaçam</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Тишина и мелодия сплетаются в узор</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il silenzio e la melodia tessono una trama</span></p><p begin="2:47.260" end="2:49.990" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:47.260" end="2:47.460">ま</span><span begin="2:47.460" end="2:47.700">ほ</span><span begin="2:47.700" end="2:47.890">ろ</span><span begin="2:47.890" end="2:48.070">ば</span><span begin="2:48.180" end="2:48.380">で</span><span begin="2:48.560" end="2:48.750">目</span><span begin="2:48.750" end="2:48.960">を</span><span begin="2:48.960" end="2:49.080">見</span><span begin="2:49.190" end="2:49.440">つ</span><span begin="2:49.440" end="2:49.550">め</span><span begin="2:49.660" end="2:49.990">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在那片桃源之中 凝望彼此的眼眸</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">在那片桃源之中 凝望彼此的眼眸</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">In that paradise look into my eyes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이상향에서 눈을 바라봐</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Dans ce lieu rêvé plonge ton regard dans le mien</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">En ese lugar ideal mírame a los ojos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">In diesem paradiesischen Ort blick mir in die Augen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Nesse paraíso encaro os seus olhos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В дивном краю я смотрю тебе в глаза</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">In quella terra d&apos;incanto guardandoti negli occhi</span></p><p begin="2:50.840" end="2:55.010" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:50.840" end="2:50.990">わ</span><span begin="2:51.090" end="2:51.380">か</span><span begin="2:51.380" end="2:51.770">る</span><span begin="2:51.770" end="2:51.800">？</span><span begin="2:52.570" end="2:52.820">こ</span><span begin="2:52.820" end="2:53.110">れ</span><span begin="2:53.110" end="2:53.510">が</span><span begin="2:54.210" end="2:55.010">心</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明白吗 这就是心</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">明白嗎 這就是心</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Do you understand? This is the heart</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">알겠어 이게 마음이야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu comprends ? Voilà ce qu’est le cœur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">¿Lo entiendes? Esto es el corazón</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Verstehst du? Das hier ist das Herz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Entende isto é o coração</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Понимаешь? Вот что такое сердце</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Capisci? Questo è il cuore</span></p><p begin="2:56.950" end="2:59.270" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:56.950" end="2:57.370">躊</span><span begin="2:57.370" end="2:57.600">躇</span><span begin="2:57.600" end="2:57.810">な</span><span begin="2:57.810" end="