" xml:lang="es">Te mostraré ese cálido impacto</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Werde ich dir diesen warmen Impuls zeigen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vou mostrar a você um impacto caloroso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я покажу тебе тёплое потрясение</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ti mostrerò un caldo sussulto</span></p><p begin="3:03.730" end="3:06.040" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:03.730" end="3:04.130">コー</span><span begin="3:04.130" end="3:04.310">ダ</span><span begin="3:04.310" end="3:04.580">を</span><span begin="3:04.580" end="3:05.200">仰</span><span begin="3:05.200" end="3:05.410">い</span><span begin="3:05.410" end="3:05.610">で</span><span begin="3:05.610" end="3:05.840">か</span><span begin="3:05.840" end="3:06.040">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仰望着终曲的余韵</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">仰望著終曲的餘韻</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">After looking up toward the coda</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">코다를 올려다본 뒤</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Après avoir levé les yeux vers la coda</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Después de alzar la mirada hacia la coda</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Nachdem wir zur Coda aufgeblickt haben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Depois de erguer os olhos para a coda</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">После того как мы устремим взгляд к коде</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dopo aver alzato lo sguardo verso la coda</span></p><p begin="3:06.250" end="3:10.130" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:06.250" end="3:06.670">君</span><span begin="3:06.670" end="3:06.800">の</span><span begin="3:06.890" end="3:07.110">秘</span><span begin="3:07.110" end="3:07.320">め</span><span begin="3:07.320" end="3:07.500">る</span><span begin="3:07.750" end="3:07.950"